[en.IDEA_C23_GREAT_DEPRESSION]
Storm Empire’s Legacy

[en.IDEA_C23_GREAT_DEPRESSION_desc]
Since the collapse of the Storm Empire, the malformed military economy of Storm Island has undoubtedly plunged with it. Although there is the rise of new commercial cities like Freeport, Storm Island as a whole has been in a state of depression.
The biggest disaster came from the First Uprising, a desperate counterattack launched by the previous government of Free Equestria using all the power of the island, which ended in failure and shattered all hope here. Since then, the new government has worked hard to restore some order and production, but the unemployed still fill the streets and alleys, the vast majority of the citizens are still poor, and the vast rural or remote areas have not even established effective contact with us.
Before this situation is improved, we may need to be careful not to get involved in conflicts like the First Uprising again.

[zh.IDEA_C23_GREAT_DEPRESSION]
大萧条

[zh.IDEA_C23_GREAT_DEPRESSION_desc]
随着风暴帝国崩溃，风暴岛畸形的军事经济毫无疑问一同跌入了深渊。虽然有自由港这种新兴商业都市的崛起，但风暴岛整体上一直处于萧条状态。
最大的灾难来自第一次起义，由上一届自由小马利亚政府集全岛之力发起的孤注一掷的反攻以失败告终，将这里的希望彻底打碎。自那之后，新政府努力地恢复了一部分秩序和生产，但失业者依然充斥在大街小巷、绝大部分民众依然贫困、广大乡村和偏远地区甚至没有与我们建立有效的联系。
在这一状况得到改善之前，我们或许要小心不要再次卷入像第一次起义那样的冲突中去。
